Package: uscreen
Version: 1.2.6
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ffmpeg, adb | android-tools-adb, libdrm2
Recommends: evdi-dkms
Maintainer: majmichu1 <157926347+majmichu1@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/majmichu1/UScreen
Description: Android tablet as a USB second display and graphics tablet
 Turns an Android tablet into a low-latency second monitor for a KDE Wayland
 desktop over USB, with touch and stylus (pressure, tilt, eraser) forwarded
 back. Can also act as a plain graphics tablet for the host's own screen.
